ShortDescription: Open-source IDE for Java and Spring, built on the Zed editor.
Description: |-
  Brewery is an open-source IDE for Java and Spring, a fork of the Zed editor.
  It bundles a Java runtime, Eclipse JDT LS and its own analysis daemon, so Java
  support works without downloads. Unsigned build: Windows SmartScreen may warn.
